sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Wallet
    participant C as Crypto
    participant M as Mempool
    participant N as Miner Blockchain
    participant S as Staging UTXOState
    participant P as Peer / RPC client
    participant V as Validator node

    W->>C: sign_hash(private_key, tx_digest)
    C-->>W: (r, s) + public key
    W->>M: add_transaction(signed_tx, live_state)
    M->>C: verify_signature(public_key, tx_digest, signature)
    C-->>M: valid / invalid
    M->>M: reserve input UTXOs
    M-->>W: accepted / rejected

    P->>V: NEW_TRANSACTION or eth_sendRawTransaction
    V->>M: validate and admit signed transaction

    N->>M: get_batch(limit)
    N->>S: clone live UTXO state
    loop candidate transactions
        N->>S: apply(tx)
        S-->>N: fee or validation error
    end
    N->>S: apply_block(coinbase + valid txs)
    S-->>N: committed candidate state_root
    N->>N: build header and mine nonce
    N->>N: append block + swap staged state
    N-->>P: NEW_BLOCK broadcast

    P->>V: serialized block
    V->>V: validate_chain(chain + block)
    V->>V: verify hash, PoW, difficulty, rewards
    V->>V: replay UTXO transitions and state_root
    V-->>P: accepted block or rejection
